  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When using enslavement Gu, the Gu Master faces the resistance of the target group. Carelessness can make the enslavement fail, and severe resistance can backlash onto the Gu Master’s soul.",
      "chapters": [
        557
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Enslavement Gu at rank five can control a rank five Gu Master and is extremely precious and rare; using that rank of Gu on a weaker target wastes its value.",
      "chapters": [
        387
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beast enslavement Gu at rank four can control myriad beast kings, and a myriad beast group is a huge force for a tribe. That rank is normally not sold in Northern Plains markets, and prices for many Gu rise sharply once they reach rank four.",
      "chapters": [
        454
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-kings-and-rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Three things shape an enslavement path Gu Master’s strength: the size of the beast group, the cooperation of the enslavement Gu worms, and the foundation of the soul.",
      "chapters": [
        540
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "set-strength",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Named species pages such as Dog Enslavement Gu or Wolf Enslavement Gu record particular worms. Gu as living tools are covered on Gu worms. The cultivation path that leans on this stock is covered on Enslavement Path.",
